- `probe_network_retry.py` — 503 then post-5s retry observed on loopback
- `probe_cache_metadata.py` — on-disk `type` + `ttl`
- `reference_control.py` — 404 full-TTL control + permanent-transient mutant goes red
- `probe_empty_cache_ok.py` — empty prefix still prints `SUCCESS:cache` (the catalog regression seed)

